  (text "VBUS (40), VSYS (39), ADC_VREF (35), RUN (30) and 3V3_EN (37): no carrier connection.\nUSB supplies Pico internally. No external power source, battery charging or PC power output.\nClosed input: about 0.30 V; red LED: about 1.3 mA at Vf=2.0 V.\nA1 footprint contains both 20-pin sockets; sockets and Pico male headers listed separately in purchasing BOM."
    (at 20.32 179.07 0)
    (effects
      (font
